*> vybe-test: cobol/occurs_depending_on/test_odo_references_still_hold_values_after_count_change
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_occurs_depending_on.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 4.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ENTRY PIC 9(3) OCCURS 1 TO 6 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 101 TO WS-ENTRY(1).
    MOVE 102 TO WS-ENTRY(2).
    MOVE 103 TO WS-ENTRY(3).
    MOVE 104 TO WS-ENTRY(4).
    MOVE 2 TO WS-COUNT.
    DISPLAY WS-ENTRY(4).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ENTRY(4) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "104"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [104] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE 205 TO WS-ENTRY(4).
    DISPLAY WS-ENTRY(4).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ENTRY(4) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "205"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [205] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

